{"unit_id":"Pasumao__dsh-plugin-choice-refresh#card-zh","repo":"Pasumao/dsh-plugin-choice-refresh","commit":"65ff234f421a8edb1b273ab5d69d45c24428f7ba","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-choice-refresh 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的选择卡增强插件。它在 conversation.composer 界面接管普通待答选择交互，为 ask_user_question 和 ask_user_choice 的选择卡加入重新生成选项、更多选项按钮，并支持文字及带图片标记的选项。用户可取消当前问题并提示模型换一批选项，或保留原选项并补充选择；计划审阅卡会交还原生界面。适合希望在选项不合适或数量不足时快速调整提问结果的 Web 用户。无需额外配置或 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:771-777","lib/client.js:160-177","lib/client.js:674-693","lib/index.js:25-30"]}
{"unit_id":"Pasumao__dsh-plugin-choice-refresh#card-en","repo":"Pasumao/dsh-plugin-choice-refresh","commit":"65ff234f421a8edb1b273ab5d69d45c24428f7ba","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-choice-refresh adds two buttons to DSH Web choice cards: regenerate options or add more while keeping current choices. It supports text and image choices; plan-review cards use the native UI. No setup or API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:771-777","lib/client.js:160-177","lib/client.js:674-693","lib/index.js:25-30"]}
