{"unit_id":"Pasumao__dsh-plugin-choice-refresh#feature-regenerate","repo":"Pasumao/dsh-plugin-choice-refresh","commit":"65ff234f421a8edb1b273ab5d69d45c24428f7ba","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-choice-refresh 的功能「重新生成选项」：在普通选择卡中取消当前待答问题，并向当前会话发送 steer 提示，请模型换角度生成一批新选项后重新提问。点击「重新生成选项」触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:160-177","lib/client.js:430-447","lib/client.js:680-685"]}
